 Gander","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3718-7e8e-b25e-304160a33c5b","description":"A Tigeress","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3718-701e-be96-253ea01ec02f","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"People with which condition should avoid milk products?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Lactose intolerance involves difficulty digesting lactose, the sugar in milk, which can cause digestive symptoms after consuming dairy.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3718-7c57-a12b-074cb4469ecb","description":"Lactose intolerance","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3718-7fa2-8e7c-983f5d7c000f","description":"Cystic fibrosis","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3718-7059-a156-2380c504eb2e","description":"Sickle-cell disease","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3718-7977-a535-f61dd4ed6280","description":"Color blindness","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3718-7e6b-bd70-1ed3f7e8aca2","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What type of animal is a caribou?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Reindeer belong to the deer family; unusually, both males and females grow antlers.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3718-71f3-8cc4-72ac4dd488d4","description":"A Reindeer","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3718-7229-9225-a3efe3713499","description":"A Whale","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3718-7026-9f1f-652a62c5b920","description":"A Mouse","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3718-7d73-90fe-60dcb37a2a26","description":"A Spider","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3718-772d-af12-c74fd6b7c488","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"Pediatrics is the branch of medicine that provides care for which of these groups?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Infants receive pediatric care, and pediatricians also treat patients through adolescence.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3718-7e97-913c-40b1a0d5d6db","description":"Infants","correct_a